  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alamina Njoo Rice and Vegetable Production and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to establish an irrigation system and develop 35 hectares of land; in addition to the 150 hectares already being cultivated. The funds will also be used to rehabilitate the feeder canal and establish a revolving fund to purchase rice for processing.</narrative>
  </description>
